Sat Oct 17 17:05:54 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to version 20260901:
  * Harden dr_wav, dr_flac and dr_mp3 against malformed files:
    bounds checks for metadata, chunk and tag parsing.
  * Fix uncontrolled memory allocation when parsing FLAC PICTURE
    metadata (boo#1259811, CVE-2026-32836).
  * Fix heap buffer overflow when parsing WAV files with a malformed
    "smpl" chunk (boo#1259174, CVE-2026-29022).
  * dr_flac 0.13.4, dr_mp3 0.7.4, dr_wav 0.14.6.
  * Rebase fix-headers.patch against the restructured tests.

